  <prompt>On every form of sprk_todo, sprk_event, sprk_communication and sprk_analysis that a user can edit, make every control bound to sprk_regardingproject, sprk_regardingmatter, sprk_regardingworkassignment or sprk_regardingservicerequest read-only. First find out, read-only, which forms carry these controls and what else on those forms writes or unlocks them. The repo holds no source for these forms, so deliver the change as a checked-in, idempotent operator script with a dry run, an offline self-test, a verify mode, a snapshot-before-write apply and a guarded restore. Make sure a record created on a locked form still saves its root and its stamps.</prompt>

  <amendments source="main session, 2026-10-03, owner rounds 9-10" binding="true">
