        <cost-of-doing-nothing>Without the lock, a visible editable root control (event modal and Assign Work, communication Message form) lets a user file a row under a secure root that the job silently reverts. Without -Verify, a later form edit re-opens it with no signal. Without forceSubmit, a disabled control can drop a staged stamp from the INSERT (an under-grant).</cost-of-doing-nothing>
      </justification>
